{
    "title": "Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match",
    "description": "Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is your gateway to a relaxing tile-matching experience, seamlessly blending classic mahjong with soothing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of this mahjong journey, providing a peaceful escape from your hectic routine.\r\n\r\nSharpen your strategic skills as you pair tiles in this timeless mahjong puzzle game. Conquer challenging levels that promise to leave you refreshed and revitalized. Power-ups and obstacles add an exciting and unpredictable twist to each mahjong level.\r\n\r\nAs you progress through the game, don't forget to claim your complimentary mahjong rewards. Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is an engaging game that strikes the perfect balance between strategy and relaxation, catering to players of all skill levels.\r\n\r\nThe game's objective remains simple: match open pairs of identical tiles and clear the board. With its captivating gameplay, Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match has won the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts worldwide. Get ready for a classic mahjong solitaire adventure that will keep you coming back for more!\r\n\r\n\r\nHow To Play\r\n\r\n- Match the same tiles on the board!\r\n- Tap two of the same tiles to remove them!\r\n- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n- Easy to learn and quite addictive\r\n- No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing matching tiles\r\n- Beautiful graphics and various layouts\r\n- Hours of gameplay for you to enjoy\r\n- Free to play and no wifi needed\r\n\r\n\r\nWith thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, dominoes games, chess games, or other board games, then Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is the perfect game for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is your gateway to a relaxing tile-matching experience, seamlessly blending classic mahjong with soothing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of this mahjong journey, providing a peaceful escape from your hectic routine.<br><br>Sharpen your strategic skills as you pair tiles in this timeless mahjong puzzle game. Conquer challenging levels that promise to leave you refreshed and revitalized. Power-ups and obstacles add an exciting and unpredictable twist to each mahjong level.<br><br>As you progress through the game, don&#39;t forget to claim your complimentary mahjong rewards. Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is an engaging game that strikes the perfect balance between strategy and relaxation, catering to players of all skill levels.<br><br>The game&#39;s objective remains simple: match open pairs of identical tiles and clear the board. With its captivating gameplay, Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match has won the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts worldwide. Get ready for a classic mahjong solitaire adventure that will keep you coming back for more!<br><br><br>How To Play<br><br>- Match the same tiles on the board!<br>- Tap two of the same tiles to remove them!<br>- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!<br><br><br>Features<br><br>- Easy to learn and quite addictive<br>- No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing matching tiles<br>- Beautiful graphics and various layouts<br>- Hours of gameplay for you to enjoy<br>- Free to play and no wifi needed<br><br><br>With thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, dominoes games, chess games, or other board games, then Mahjong Solitaire - Zen Match is the perfect game for you!",
